# Local scratch, continued. Anchored with a leading slash on purpose: `images/`
# and `requirements/` are ordinary directory names a tool could create anywhere,
# and `images/` at the repo root is itself tracked (logo.png, logo.svg,
# scatter_plot.png). Only these exact stray paths are ignored.
#
# /images/icon.png duplicates the packaged src/optimuspy/images/icon.png.
# /requirements/ is the landing-page spec and mockups, not a Python
# requirements directory.
/images/icon.png
/requirements/
/samples/generate_full_drafts.py
/samples/optimize_copy.json
